      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "With the emergence of a new Ark, we must \r\ntalk about the investigation, the matter of Iris,\r\nand the significant possibilities related to\r\nthis series of events—",
        "Jp" : "新たなアークが現れ、その調査やイリスの件\r\nそしてこの一連の出来事に関わる重大な可能性に\r\nついて話し合わなければならぬ中――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 254605,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
