      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "This time, there is no trace of Mysial. \r\nIt can't be that they've been taken \r\naway like Mayleaf, can it?",
        "Jp" : "今度はミシアルの姿が見当たらないのだ\r\nまさかメイリーフのように連れ去られた\r\nなどということはないだろうが"
      },
