      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh! You are referring to Lady Mysial! \r\nShe definitely walked by here \r\nand went toward the Relay Station.",
        "Jp" : "ああ！　ミシアルさまのことですね\r\nたしかにここをお通りになって\r\n宿場区の方へと歩いていかれました"
