      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But the truth is—when I said hello,\r\nto my surprise, she told me \r\nto keep it a secret from everyone—",
        "Jp" : "でも実は――びっくりしてご挨拶したら\r\nみんなには内緒と言われてしまって――"
