      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Lady Mysial has always been in the \r\nAudience Chamber as the White Dragon's \r\npriestess and seldom steps outside, \r\nor even within the Temple itself.",
        "Jp" : "ミシアルさまは白竜の巫女として\r\nずっと謁見の間にいらして\r\n外を――、神殿内ですら\r\nあまり出歩かれることがないから"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 384469,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I think it might be that she wanted a break,\r\nor perhaps just some time alone;\r\nsomething along the lines of that.",
        "Jp" : "息抜きというか、一人になりたいというか\r\nそんなご気分になられたんじゃないかなって"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 384470,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
